@startuml Blood Stock Management System - DFD Level 1 (Blood Issuance)

' Styling
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam process {
    BackgroundColor #F8BBD0
    BorderColor #C2185B
    FontSize 10
}
skinparam storage {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #F57C00
}
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #FFE0B2
    BorderColor #E64A19
}

title Blood Stock Management System\nDFD Level 1 - Blood Issuance (Process 5.0)

' External Entities
actor "Recipient" as recipient
actor "Staff" as staff

' Sub-processes
rectangle "5.1\nReceive\nBlood\nRequest" as P51 #F8BBD0
rectangle "5.2\nCheck\nBlood\nAvailability" as P52 #F8BBD0
rectangle "5.3\nSelect\nBlood\nPacks" as P53 #F8BBD0
rectangle "5.4\nCreate\nIssuance\nRecord" as P54 #F8BBD0
rectangle "5.5\nUpdate\nBlood Pack\nStatus" as P55 #F8BBD0
rectangle "5.6\nUpdate\nInventory\nSummary" as P56 #F8BBD0
rectangle "5.7\nGenerate\nIssuance\nReceipt" as P57 #F8BBD0

' Data Stores
database "D4: Blood Packs" as D4 #FFF9C4
database "D5: Blood Issues" as D5 #FFF9C4
database "D8: Blood Stock\nSummary" as D8 #FFF9C4

' External Processes
rectangle "4.0\nInventory\nManagement" as P4 #FFCCBC

' Input Flows
recipient --> P51 : Blood\nRequest
staff --> P51 : Recipient\nDetails

' Process Flows
P51 --> P52 : Request\nDetails
P52 --> P53 : Available\nBlood
P53 --> P54 : Selected\nPacks
P54 --> P55 : Issuance\nRecord
P55 --> P56 : Updated\nPacks
P56 --> P57 : Updated\nSummary
P57 --> recipient : Issuance\nReceipt
P57 --> staff : Issuance\nConfirmation

' Data Store Interactions
P52 <--> D4 : Query Available\nBlood Packs
P52 <--> D8 : Check Stock\nLevels
P53 <--> D4 : Read Blood\nPack Details
P54 --> D5 : Create Issuance\nRecord
P55 --> D4 : Update Pack\nStatus to USED
P56 --> D8 : Decrement\nAvailable Count

' Inter-Process Communication
P52 --> P4 : Stock\nQuery
P56 --> P4 : Inventory\nUpdate

note right of P51
  <b>Request Information:</b>
  • Recipient name
  • Recipient type
  • Blood group required
  • Units needed
  • Contact details
  • Urgency level
end note

note right of P52
  <b>Availability Check:</b>
  • Search by blood group
  • Check expiry dates
  • Verify pack status
  • Calculate available units
end note

note right of P53
  <b>Pack Selection Criteria:</b>
  • Oldest packs first (FIFO)
  • Nearest expiry date
  • Matching blood group
  • AVAILABLE status only
end note

note bottom of P54
  <b>Issuance Record Contains:</b>
  • Unique issue code
  • Recipient details
  • Blood group
  • Units requested/issued
  • Issue date
  • Issued by (staff ID)
  • Selected blood pack IDs
end note

note bottom of P55
  Updates blood pack status
  from AVAILABLE to USED
  and records issuance link
end note

@enduml
